00:03:49.896 --> 00:03:54.133
moving forward within the music industry?

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:55.768
These cases are always

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:57.136
pretty challenging cases

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:58.705
to establish liability,

00:03:58.705 --> 00:04:00.006
and I think this case will make it

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:01.040
even more difficult.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:01.774
And that was the case

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:02.408
that Ed Sheeran

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:03.843
and his team was making was Red

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:06.446
Hook in pop culture, in pop music,

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:07.280
I should say.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.014
This for chord

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:10.049
progression is used in lots of songs.

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:12.051
And if there had been a determination

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:13.653
that he was liable for damages

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:14.654
