00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:29.035
be free from these kinds of losses.

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:31.170
So this is a significant verdict.

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:32.972
I think it's a significant verdict

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:35.074
for other songwriters as well.

00:04:35.074 --> 00:04:35.375
Right.

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:36.509
Really setting that precedent

00:04:36.509 --> 00:04:37.143
moving forward.

